        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _phoneDialogue._sentences.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _finishedDialogue._sentences.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogue._sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: Great job pal! Well, I know I said I'd grab you tonight, but the house
        is almost cleared out now...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogue._sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'Why don''t you just stay there again tonight? You can have your own
        little sleepover! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogue._sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: I'll come get you tomorrow - we can spend your big day together, just
        you and me!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogue._sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: Go watch a bit of TV, pal. It'll help you relax.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_finishedDialogue._sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: The line is dead...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogueMorning._sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: Why dont you go ahead and take some more pictures for me, pal?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogueMorning._sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: 'If you can keep yourself busy for a few hours, I''ll swing by tonight
        and grab you! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
